<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>标定 on 如是有为</title><link>https://sensor.fans/tags/%E6%A0%87%E5%AE%9A/</link><description>Recent content in 标定 on 如是有为</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sensor.fans/tags/%E6%A0%87%E5%AE%9A/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>编码器开发专题-角度误差分析下卷</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/stdtcsbce12dpbb5yshda/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/stdtcsbce12dpbb5yshda/</guid><description>&lt;p>继上卷内容本文主讲：怎么把它们补掉。标定这件事，网上资料一大抄，但真正上手时会卡在三个地方：数据怎么采才对、椭圆怎么拟合才稳、系数怎么算才不翻倍。这篇按实际操作的顺序走一遍，每一步给做法、给判据、给能跑的代码。全文所有公式都经过数值仿真验证，补偿后残差能压到噪声底。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>